sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer as External Producer
    participant Queue as Redis / GCP Pub/Sub<br/>6379/TCP or 443/TCP
    participant AP as Async Processor
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>HTTP
    participant Gateway as llm-d-router<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Consumer as External Consumer

    Note over Producer,Consumer: Flow 1: Async Request Processing

    Producer->>Queue: Submit RequestMessage<br/>Redis: URL creds / GCP: IAM<br/>Optional TLS
    Queue->>AP: Poll/consume request<br/>Transport-specific protocol
    AP->>Prom: Query capacity metrics<br/>HTTP (no auth)
    Note over AP: Evaluate dispatch gates<br/>(budget + admission)
    AP->>Gateway: POST inference request<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+ / mTLS
    Gateway-->>AP: Inference response
    AP->>Queue: Write ResultMessage<br/>Optional TLS
    Consumer->>Queue: Read result<br/>Optional TLS

    Note over Producer,Consumer: Flow 2: Retry with Backoff

    Note over AP: Request shed or error
    AP->>Queue: Enqueue to retry sorted set<br/>Redis 6379/TCP, Optional TLS
    Note over Queue: Backoff timer expires<br/>(exponential backoff)
    Queue->>AP: Re-dequeue request
    AP->>Gateway: Retry dispatch<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+ / mTLS
    Gateway-->>AP: Inference response
    AP->>Queue: Write result or<br/>expire if deadline exceeded
